{"id":276110222,"title":"250 .http响应结果-express框架-中间件使用","summary":"Http模块-http发送网络请求和axios本质（掌握）我们要下载axios!!!!!!!!才可以去使用他http给我们提供了一个get方法用来发送网络请求的。","content":"<p>Http模块-http发送网络请求和axios本质（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p>我们要下载axios!!!!!!!!才可以去使用他<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782976847581-918fc95f-ce2f-4c94-95d9-e64e6277615b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782976251238-464597d5-a068-44d1-9a18-d8ab81861f21.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>http给我们提供了一个get方法用来发送网络请求的。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782976490929-a5dab51a-6640-47b0-ac97-caa8bd7273c3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这里的request和我们的服务器建立了一个可读流，这个流可能会向我们的服务器里面写入一些东西。我们要自动调一下end（表示我们已经写入结束了，服务器才会读取结束，读取结束他才会向我们客户端返回数据）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782977242680-063932ec-9abc-40f8-aa14-c413af72d2a8.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782977281539-b98d8cb6-445e-48f9-837e-ca7e54160a2b.png\" alt=\"\">2和1的结果是一样的。</p>\n<p>我们安装好了axios后<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782977346443-48215017-e4d1-4b17-bb1b-92f711ed7c16.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>axios在node的使用的时候是基于http底层模块的。在浏览器是xhr的。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782977388524-85400b86-d95d-44dd-818c-a92e98fbe5ba.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Http模块-文件上传-文件上传的流程（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">理解</font>）</p>\n<p>文件上传必须使用post！</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782977878989-42a82015-0fa4-465a-bc95-44d7ec1a763c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782978054687-94cca03a-477a-4f81-a3a3-af7e70639da0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782978067411-b9f01a38-090c-4034-a69d-27f59c7060d7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>文件上传的流程是这样的。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782978775567-2d062019-0ad8-4bdb-974a-895e5b48c26a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782978500217-9021dbb3-638e-4c04-b867-0921ad0f23bf.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们把从客户端传过来的数据，写入到foo文件里面，那我们表示把客户端传过来的数据保存到本地了吗，文件上传的整个流程</p>\n<p>我们现在的文件见打不开，因为他的格式有问题。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782978684163-6fecd774-9654-4a63-8fee-de350352fd39.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Http模块-文件上传-文件上传的实现（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">理解</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782981732438-6d555196-1007-418e-a66b-6fdef6de077b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>\\r\\n是一个空格。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782981833491-2f1f72c9-6fe6-442b-941e-4c8bc08f1a2f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>\\s\\s:是匹配我们的空格的。相当于\\r\\n（一个\\s一个空格）</p>\n<p>我们的后面还有这些东西。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782981939656-6ece6ec2-8a38-4292-bb94-65c34ae99d04.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782982093909-f80e2312-03ae-405d-a248-256140c011b1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782982486177-d099c890-d8bd-4990-a683-438cc4760645.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782982108717-d1d442ed-187c-4219-adec-f84d59a2d9fc.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782982502331-6686559e-5ed4-4962-8e6c-9b32a339dcf3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782982248297-a9afe9ad-79b8-46be-8b15-f71c2c35df76.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782982314892-034873ae-32ec-498c-a5a4-81a7588e0208.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Http模块-文件上传-浏览器代码实现（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782983463754-d19cfb3a-ebec-47c3-968c-d5d2bd2658bb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782982641812-a58e5650-0890-4b24-a7be-b27b4ec7e8fc.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这个就是文件上传我们所需要的<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782983069091-2d354496-9b9d-471c-aac8-185f23df403f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们这里的名字要修改<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782983261419-36cfac0e-d23a-4474-9c94-840295215cec.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782983387980-38739b66-5fb0-49e9-bae7-4154139b5743.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782983501802-15b6e282-3b94-4ab0-828d-324ad6f33e2f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782983512104-af1c77a2-7f61-4aaf-8055-ceeacb947fe5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782983541885-c89ff48c-1a7d-496f-adc5-ae5c673f30ab.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>express-express的内容概述和介绍（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">理解</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782983588572-2814b66c-70d6-48a1-9f55-2d9fd6fa9804.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">中间件非常重要！！！</font></p>\n<p>express-express的基本使用（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782983979352-7aeee44d-37a4-4dc5-a80c-0c862d197311.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>大多数都是方式2，自己搭建<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782984085846-52096998-cb29-43d3-b06f-e360ef382c4b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782984508901-098772cf-8d90-4e97-a16b-ebca2e060c6a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782984548847-c68d2223-841a-4330-a1b3-9c80b742daba.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这里敲回车+clear<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782984566730-7f33cd6e-8e08-4199-b3f6-0a0d7a426b29.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>然后<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782984594513-b7d5513b-676a-4fec-8cde-f5e15e10a7d3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782985529050-69538371-e40d-4f33-9f8f-b60681415d43.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782985517367-af120d95-ddd3-456c-8ae3-d3605ca7a7a7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782985595142-ee190c7c-e4f2-4a2d-a629-72b9ed96d3d5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>express-认识express中间件作用（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782985726441-7867b0f6-f00b-4117-a72a-165f5fa18785.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这是一个中间件<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782985852181-498062be-1f98-4c50-8891-614a39bdbc48.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782985869968-6a5fc2e4-d790-4e2a-bb8f-f0bffbd4037b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782985943507-a823cf96-9f8c-4a3f-9e69-835825383e75.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782986265156-a16a5211-8e27-4064-9d0f-02723c299a5c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782986071649-fdbffb81-b438-4b35-9e1b-fe2663eccc23.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782986085217-d999f932-9a49-4a4b-82d3-5df85f561b82.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>在这里，next会自己去赵下一个中间件，他不要传参数，有特定情况再传。use:是最普通的中间件。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782986252539-cd4db6b6-b149-4891-8b99-250f2978eb69.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782986301077-34e4f693-fcab-4e57-9f6e-f26bbaf029ca.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>express-注册中间件-注册普通的中间件</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782986463043-898470b6-6f8a-4372-b6e5-ebe620b8fc18.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>他是一个最普通的中间件，在任何情况下都可以匹配上。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782986592397-6c0e2e60-dbf8-4958-8769-d6b71fee9203.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782986782275-492384bb-4250-42a3-a97e-4a187fd57c8c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>express-</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782986803170-9f164d86-33e3-4950-b0e0-ab72244ee942.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782986817864-981377e6-d983-41d1-97c1-3359aa9ba324.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782986825821-f5592755-6556-426e-b64c-75c58aa01ee2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782986832918-1d7dc170-4d14-410c-9d5f-28b1fafc9041.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782986841914-edae6e35-363e-4c8e-9d1e-290c1adc1c59.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782986853496-2d35fc8f-6015-4592-9397-b0664ee9d8d0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782986861849-502100b5-37aa-47d3-a27d-a58defc00f43.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782986874254-61ac48f2-1a09-4fc9-9066-aae5d9d20e0a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782986898352-406c4e45-4c1e-4f8b-965e-c2ed17032523.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782986906257-2d05d0c6-53e7-42f6-a466-a3a2f5e172ca.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782986946859-3b70d448-294e-4a67-8cde-8e5a3fc72550.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n","contentFormat":"markdown","source":"yuque","cover":"","category_id":80707835,"category":{"id":80707835,"name":"nodejs","description":""},"created_at":"2026-07-02T06:19:56.000Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T14:46:12.000Z","view_count":0,"like_count":0,"is_top":0,"is_featured":0,"tags":[],"status":"published","yuqueUrl":"https://www.yuque.com/woyaoyizhishuidajue/hkk7kv/ylxvctv1s78hyxeh","slug":"ylxvctv1s78hyxeh","wordCount":574}